gases-soyuz-isoflux = Isoflux
reagent-name-soyuz-isoflux = Isoflux
reagent-desc-soyuz-isoflux = Isoflux atmospheric gas (IF).
gases-soyuz-resonite = Resonite
reagent-name-soyuz-resonite = Resonite
reagent-desc-soyuz-resonite = Resonite atmospheric gas (RZ).
gases-soyuz-pyroxite = Pyroxite
reagent-name-soyuz-pyroxite = Pyroxite
reagent-desc-soyuz-pyroxite = Pyroxite atmospheric gas (PX).
gases-soyuz-coronite = Coronite
reagent-name-soyuz-coronite = Coronite
reagent-desc-soyuz-coronite = Coronite atmospheric gas (CRN).
gases-soyuz-gravion = Gravion
reagent-name-soyuz-gravion = Gravion
reagent-desc-soyuz-gravion = Gravion atmospheric gas (GV).
gases-soyuz-radion = Radion
reagent-name-soyuz-radion = Radion
reagent-desc-soyuz-radion = Radion (RD): production consumes 1/20 of the limiting portion per pass. Open air emits min(moles × 0.02, 20) rad/s per tile, capped at 1000 mol. Closed containers do not emit radiation.
gases-soyuz-quartzgas = QuartzGas
reagent-name-soyuz-quartzgas = QuartzGas
reagent-desc-soyuz-quartzgas = QuartzGas atmospheric gas (QZ).
gases-soyuz-impulsegas = ImpulseGas
reagent-name-soyuz-impulsegas = ImpulseGas
reagent-desc-soyuz-impulsegas = Impulse (IM): at least 5 mol in the tile atmosphere directly under a generator grants a non-stacking 25% power bonus. Gas inside containers has no effect.
gases-soyuz-iney = Iney
reagent-name-soyuz-iney = Iney
reagent-desc-soyuz-iney = Iney (IN): half of the open gas becomes water vapor each pass. Stronger cleaning affects only the current tile: volume clamp(converted moles × 50, 5, 100). Stable in closed mixtures.
gases-soyuz-diborane = Diborane
reagent-name-soyuz-diborane = Diborane
reagent-desc-soyuz-diborane = Diborane (DB): EF + P → 2 DB, requiring at least 1 mol of unconsumed Boracite catalyst. Production fraction: 1/20 per pass. Oxidation with oxygen retains its 1/2 fraction, including inside containers; heat is halved and total explosion intensity is capped at 18.
gases-soyuz-gammagas = GammaGas
reagent-name-soyuz-gammagas = GammaGas
reagent-desc-soyuz-gammagas = Gamma (GM): radiation collector power ×2, fuel consumption ×0.10 relative to plasma. Does not emit radiation by itself.
gases-soyuz-forsazh = Forsazh
reagent-name-soyuz-forsazh = Forsazh
reagent-desc-soyuz-forsazh = Forsazh atmospheric gas (FS).
gases-soyuz-sumrak = Sumrak
reagent-name-soyuz-sumrak = Sumrak
reagent-desc-soyuz-sumrak = Sumrak atmospheric gas (SM).
gases-soyuz-lumin = Lumin
reagent-name-soyuz-lumin = Lumin
reagent-desc-soyuz-lumin = Lumin atmospheric gas (LM).
gases-soyuz-lazarus = Lazarus
reagent-name-soyuz-lazarus = Lazarus
reagent-desc-soyuz-lazarus = Lazarus atmospheric gas (LZ).
gases-soyuz-chromatin = Chromatin
reagent-name-soyuz-chromatin = Chromatin
reagent-desc-soyuz-chromatin = Chromatin atmospheric gas (CH).
gases-soyuz-tlec = Tlec
reagent-name-soyuz-tlec = Tlec
reagent-desc-soyuz-tlec = Tlec (TL): 2 PX + DTN + T → 1 TL, requiring at least 1 mol of unconsumed Coronite catalyst. Production fraction: 1/20 per pass, without Coronite's yield bonus. Detonates after 12 seconds in open air; each tile's total intensity cap is 10/20/20–35 depending on its gas amount.

gases-soyuz-detonite = Detonite
reagent-name-soyuz-detonite = Detonite
reagent-desc-soyuz-detonite = Detonite (DTN): tier III intermediate used only for Tlec. 2 PX + RZ → 1 DTN, 50–80 K, 100–300 kPa, minimum 10 PX and 5 RZ mol, fraction 1/5, Q +40 kJ/block.
gas-detonite-abbreviation = DTN
gases-soyuz-boracite = Boracite
reagent-name-soyuz-boracite = Boracite
reagent-desc-soyuz-boracite = Boracite (BRC): tier III intermediate used only as a Diborane catalyst. KX + IF + RZ → 1 BRC, 60–100 K, 80–250 kPa, minimum 5 mol each, fraction 1/5, Q +30 kJ/block.
gas-boracite-abbreviation = BRC

